AmQ2aJgcHJ.jpg"},{"id":71930,"name":"Gustave Kervern","role":"Messina","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cRbHFJJ5yAWUbENYhcLDmnCZUHX.jpg"},{"id":1141,"name":"Hélène Vincent","role":"Thérèse","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lJJ9WjZJI6cVCpFTsXoHqSDW23v.jpg"},{"id":3991731,"name":"Maxence Lapérouse","role":"Stan"},{"id":1424100,"name":"Vincent Heneine","role":"Eliott","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nxwmi1VghKtUMgXkbemNZT6txo1.jpg"},{"id":583325,"name":"Mathis Bour","role":"Roman"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","overview":"Victor Pandaloni, per tutti Panda, è un ex-agente di polizia che si è ritirato in un angolo della Camargue per abbracciare uno stile di vita hippy. Per un caso del destino è costretto a tornare in servizio, ma a modo suo."},{"language":"en-US","overview":"Relaxed pacifist, matcha addict, and convinced vegan, Panda runs a small shack in a remote corner of the Camargue. No phone, no computer, no car; he lives with his 16-year-old in this perfect cocoon of peace and serenity, avoiding anything resembling conflict. How to imagine that this wise man in flip-flops and a faded t-shirt was once a cop? And not just any cop. One of the best. Unfortunately, even in paradise, there's no way to be completely peaceful. When his former life comes knocking at the door, Panda finds himself obliged to return to duty... But in his own way. Without weapons or violence and not too early in the morning. Zen, you know."},{"language":"fr-FR","overview":"Pacifiste détendu, matcha'addict et vegan convaincu, Panda tient une petite paillote dans un coin reculé de Camargue. Pas de portable, pas d'ordi, pas de voiture, il vit avec son ado de 16 ans dans ce parfait cocon de paix et de sérénité, et fuit tout ce qui ressemble de près ou de loin à un conflit. Comment imaginer que ce grand sage en tongs et t-shirt délavé ait un jour été flic ? Et pas n'importe lequel. Un des meilleurs. Hélas, même au paradis, y'a pas moyen d'être tranquille. Le jour où son ancienne vie vient frapper à la porte, Panda se retrouve obligé de reprendre du service... Mais à sa façon. Sans arme ni violence et pas trop tôt la matin. Zen, quoi."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/22WiqR8tlzQC5yp09xPm94gQP0Y.jpg","seasons":[{"seasonNumber":0,"name":{"value":"Speciali","language":"it-IT"},"year":2023,"episodeCount":1,"posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229641/season/0"},{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2023,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229641/season/1"},{"seasonNumber":2,"name":{"value":"Stagione 2","language":"it-IT"},"year":2025,"episodeCount":6,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fMOGnpn0fNj3wwyfQlPMbkLXua6.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/229641/season/2"}],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":229641,"type":"tv","originalLanguage":"fr-FR","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"fr":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg","language":"fr","width":900,"height":1350},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xCx9egLXjIck4qKS7YGJ4ShAUTU.jpg","language":"fr","width":900,"height":1350},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oPlR2te16dTerkl4iBXqvUFOq3Y.jpg","p